| Change | Why it matters |
|--------|----------------|
| `helmet()` | Sets `Content-Security-Policy`, `X-Content-Type-Options`, `X-Frame-Options`, etc. to reduce XSS, clickjacking, MIME‑type sniffing. |
| `cors({ origin })` | Restricts which domains can access the API. In prod set `CORS_ORIGIN` to a whitelist. |
| `xss-clean()` | Sanitises any string that might carry `<script>` or other XSS payloads. |
| `express-rate-limit` | Throttles clients to prevent denial‑of‑service or brute‑force. |
| `morgan('combined')` | Structured logs in Apache Common (or you can replace with winston for more control). |
| `dotenv` | Allows you to keep secrets and config outside the repo. |
| **Error handling** | Guarantees consistent JSON error responses and logs. |
| **`process.env.PORT`** | Makes the containerised deployment simpler. |

