```

> **Why?**  
> - `helmet` sets common secure headers (e.g., `X‑Content‑Type‑Options`).  
> - `cors` prevents cross‑site attacks if you accidentally expose sensitive data to untrusted origins.  
> - Rate‑limiting thwarts brute‑force and DoS attacks.

